5,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I want to make sure the new fee structure is fair, but also that it isn't too hard for the person managing the money to handle.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to avoid guesswork this time. I want to see the actual numbers to ensure we have a stable financial foundation for the coming year.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree we need facts. However, we should also consider how the fee structure affects the atmosphere for new members joining the club.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not get too bogged down in spreadsheets! I'm more worried about the vibe. Why are people hesitating to show up lately? We need to see who's actually coming.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A ""vibe"" isn't a metric, May. If we want a rational structure, we need to know who is actually using the club and who is just a ghost member.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, that makes sense. I wonder if we can see how much time the treasurer actually spends on the books? It seems like a lot of work.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Administrative time is one thing, but the priority is the bottom line. We need to know exactly what went out and what actually came in.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"If we focus too much on ""ghost members,"" we might create a system that feels like surveillance. We should look at how people joined mid-year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Minako! If the fees feel like a chore or a barrier, people will just stay home. I want to know about the turnout since summer.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Surveillance is a strong word. I call it accountability. It's hardly fair for a handful of us to carry the club while others pay a pittance for zero effort.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want anyone to feel stressed or overwhelmed by the paperwork. Maybe we can find a way to keep it simple for everyone?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Simplicity is fine, provided it is based on a realistic budget. I'm not interested in a ""simple"" plan that leaves us bankrupt by autumn.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,Let's look at the historical records too. Seeing how the named-grade years handled this might give us a perspective on what worked in the past.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm still thinking about those who are on the fence. I want to know about the quieter members at the winter social. Are they drifting away?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Let's stop speculating. I'll look into the actual attendance and the workload. It's time we saw who is actually doing the heavy lifting here.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the treasurer's hours and the ledger. I want to see if the work is too much for one person.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the bank statements and the ledger. I need to see the actual cash flow to avoid any more guessing.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I'll check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years. I want to preserve the club's welcoming nature.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm going for the weekday turnout since summer and the quieter members at the winter social. Let's figure out why the energy has dipped!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record. Let's see how uneven this ""community"" really is.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
